g guidelines. All submissions must be made through the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"4\",{\"href\":\"https://ieee.atyponrex.com/journal/tsc-cs\",\"className\":\"not-prose text-site-link active:text-site-link visited:text-site-link-visited font-normal hover:underline\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":\"IEEE Author Portal\"}],\". Please select \\\"Special Issue on Large Language Models in Service-Oriented Ecosystems Design: Advances and Applications\\\" during submission. Manuscripts must not be published or under review elsewhere.This Special Issue accepts extended versions of papers from conferences or workshops, under certain restrictions: the extended paper must present 30% additional core contributions (i.e. not limited to extending related works and background information sections) and must have a similarity score lower than 50% relative to the proceedings version. The proceedings paper must be provided at the time of submission and a description of the extension must be included in the cover letter.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"style-p font-light \",\"children\":[\"In addition to submitting your paper to \",[\"$\",\"i\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"IEEE Transactions on Services Computing\"}],\", you are also encouraged to upload the data related to your paper to \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://ieee-dataport.org/\",\"className\":\"not-prose text-site-link active:text-site-link visited:text-site-link-visited font-normal hover:underline\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":\"IEEE DataPort\"}],\". IEEE DataPort is IEEE's data platform that supports the storage and publishing of datasets while also providing access to thousands of research datasets. Uploading your dataset to IEEE DataPort will strengthen your paper and will support research reproducibility. Your paper and the dataset can be linked, providing a good opportunity for you to increase the number of citations you receive. Data can be uploaded to IEEE DataPort prior to submitting your paper or concurrent with the paper submission.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",false,\"$undefined\"]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col col-span-3 xl:col-span-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto xl:mx-0 my-4 xl:my-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-center md:justify-end\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$10\",null,{\"fallback\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full hidden xl:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-0 p-4 xl:my-4 xl:px-6 xl:py-4 w-full xl:w-5/6 border mx-auto xl:mx-0 xl:float-right rounded-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 h-6 w-32 bg-light-grey animate-pulse rounded\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-light-grey py-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center space-x-6 xl:space-x-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-12 bg-light-grey rounded-lg animate-pulse flex-shrink-0\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-4 bg-light-grey rounded animate-pulse xl:line-clamp-2\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-light-grey py-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center space-x-6 xl:space-x-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-12 bg-light-grey rounded-lg animate-pulse flex-shrink-0\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-4 bg-light-grey rounded animate-pulse xl:line-clamp-2\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-light-grey py-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center space-x-6 xl:space-x-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-12 bg-light-grey rounded-lg animate-pulse flex-shrink-0\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-4 bg-light-grey rounded animate-pulse xl:line-clamp-2\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-t b